          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased maritime congestion and port/terminal delays on routes servicing semiconductor and component suppliers directly slow shipments and raise lead times and costs for AI hardware, thereby increasing supply‑chain frictions affecting US–China tech competition." />
