          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained higher oil prices increase government and national energy-company revenues, enabling sovereign wealth funds and state-linked firms to redirect capital into strategic tech and space-communications projects." />
