          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in sabotage and espionage incidents targeting satellite operators or their supply chains triggers national security and telecom regulators to open investigations, demand audits, and tighten compliance requirements for space-communications firms." />
