          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="High‑visibility incidents that demonstrate AI's battlefield or intelligence utility shift investor expectations and drive increased funding into AI build‑out (particularly security/defense‑oriented AI) in markets aligned with the parties to the conflict." />
