          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="New restrictive export/operational rules on AI-enabled control systems and dual‑use industrial electronics reduce availability and timely servicing of critical oilfield and refinery control equipment, causing slower production and lower export flow rates as operators delay output to avoid safety incidents." />
