          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Stronger AI export controls and licensing restrictions by Western and allied regulators reduce Russia's access to advanced AI-enabled targeting, ISR and weapon automation, degrading its operational tempo and thereby reducing near-to-medium-term kinetic intensity." />
