          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Stronger US–China export controls and component shortages force manufacturers to reroute semiconductor- and hardware-heavy shipments through alternative hubs and transshipment points (including routes via the Gulf/Suez), increasing port congestion and route delays that raise the maritime shipping bottleneck index." />
