          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Political pressure that forces commercial satellite imagery or comms providers to restrict distribution of regional monitoring data reduces market transparency about production and shipments, raising risk premia and pushing benchmark oil prices higher." />
