          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased political pressure (e.g., demands to block or remove foreign space‑communications vendors) leads policymakers to adopt tighter cross‑border controls and procurement rules that are then extended to AI development and trade, raising AI regulatory restrictiveness in the US–China tech rivalry." />
